usage: rebis.alchemy [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

Alchemical Treatise Bridge & Operations (advanced v2)

positional arguments:
  COMMAND
    ladder              Basil Valentine alchemical ladder
    opus                Full 12-operation opus report
    stilling            Zosimos stilling analysis
    structure           Alchemical structural analysis
    retrosynth          Retrosynthetic stone synthesis
    grand-seq           Grand alchemical sequence
    catalyst            Green fire catalyst analysis
    wavelength          Optimal photocatalytic wavelength
    screen              Screen catalyst library
    binding             Third engine binding computation
    host                Suggest host for guest
    decode              Artephius cryptic text decode
    decode-mol          Artephius molecule decode
    treatise            Treatise taxonomy / design
    operations          List 12 alchemical operations
    portico             Zosimos portico consistency check
    list                List available tools
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
